{"version":1,"content":"<p>聯合國安理會周四（15日）舉行中東問題公開辯論會。</p><p>中國常駐聯合國代表傅聰在會上發言，指出巴勒斯坦問題始終是中東問題的核心，絕不能被忽視和邊緣化，呼籲解決中東地區矛盾根源，糾正巴勒斯坦歷史不公。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T02:19:49.687586+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T01:33:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T17:17:43.764703+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T02:17:42.638158+00:00","content_hash":"2e99d94ef61555c0b34707534d9d33e4fa418921f4f448720e008c5b411828b6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}